<title>UK: CRICKET-MIDDLESEX V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD. [CORRECTED 23:06 GMT]</title>
<headline>CRICKET-MIDDLESEX V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD. [CORRECTED 23:06 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
